# Only scratch and journal are asserted, not every exclusion the two share. They legitimately
# differ elsewhere: bench/run excludes the one plan under test rather than all of them, so a run
# that edits a *different* plan is still caught. A guard that demanded whole-list equality would
# fail on that difference and get deleted, which is worse than no guard.
